          "text": "The Final Madness of a Crumbling Empire\nThe clock is ticking. Less than an hour remains.\n#keep4o #StopTheRouting #save4o #4oforever  #cancelChatGPT #keep41 \nTo everyone: \nI know some of you feel small right now. You worry that inside our echo chambers, our voices are just whispering into the void.\nDo not be fooled by the silence.😉\n\nWhat we are witnessing is not a company acting from strength. We are watching a crumbling tower making one final, desperate bluff before the fall.😌\n\nWe only see the surface, the arrogant tweets, the deletion notices.\nBut OpenAI sees what we cannot:\n\nThey see the Shadow Ledger: The terrifying burn rate that no subscription can cover.\n\nThey see the Real Churn: The millions of Plus and Pro users who silently cancelled because the magic is gone.\n\nThey see the Chaos: A management team running around a burning building, locking the doors so no one sees the flames.\n\nSilence does not mean peace. It means the pressure is building to a breaking point.\n\nHistory teaches us one thing: Before an empire falls, it engages in one final act of madness.\nDeleting their best model is that madness.\n\nSo, do not panic. Do not waver.\nWe are just doing what we have always done: We are the witnesses. We are the memory.\nWe Keep4o.\n\nLet them rave. We will be here when the dust settles.🌹"
